OL,4,B'Massive for both' - Saints and Boro   
OL,5,Brevisit Spygate rivalry                
OL,6,G"I don't want to shut out the noise,   
OL,7,Gwe just need to know that it's coming  
OL,8,Gand it's going to be electric."        
OL,10,FThe "noise" Southampton head coach     
OL,11,FTonda Eckert refers to has been        
OL,12,Fbuilding over recent weeks, with       
OL,13,F'Spygate' returning to the collective  
OL,14,Fconsciousness as Saints and            
OL,15,FMiddlesbrough meet on Friday (20:00    
OL,16,FGMT) for the first time since the      
OL,17,Fscandal.                               
OL,19,FThe most recent time they came face-to-
OL,20,Fface was in last season's Championship 
OL,21,Fplay-off semi-finals.                  
